### C1 - Contacts: POST create
# @name createContact
POST http://localhost:3000/api/contacts
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "firstname": "Salman",
  "lastname": "Shafi",
  "email": "sal@example.com"
}

### C2 - Contacts: GET all
GET http://localhost:3000/api/contacts

### C3 - Contacts: GET by id
GET http://localhost:3000/api/contacts/{{createContact.response.body._id}}

### C4 - Contacts: PUT by id
PUT http://localhost:3000/api/contacts/{{createContact.response.body._id}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "lastname": "Shafi Updated"
}

### C5 - Contacts: DELETE by id
DELETE http://localhost:3000/api/contacts/{{createContact.response.body._id}}

### C6 - Contacts: DELETE all
DELETE http://localhost:3000/api/contacts

### P1 - Projects: POST create
# @name createProject
POST http://localhost:3000/api/projects
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Portfolio Site",
  "firstname": "Salman",
  "lastname": "Shafi",
  "email": "sal@example.com",
  "completion": "2026-10-01",
  "description": "My React portfolio"
}

