GET http://localhost:3000/api/projects

### P3 - Projects: GET by id
GET http://localhost:3000/api/projects/{{createProject.response.body._id}}

### P4 - Projects: PUT by id
PUT http://localhost:3000/api/projects/{{createProject.response.body._id}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "description": "Updated description"
}

### P5 - Projects: DELETE by id
DELETE http://localhost:3000/api/projects/{{createProject.response.body._id}}

### P6 - Projects: DELETE all
DELETE http://localhost:3000/api/projects

