### U1 - Users: POST register
# @name createUser
POST http://localhost:3000/api/users
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Salman Shafi",
  "email": "salman.test@example.com",
  "password": "Test1234"
}

### U2 - Auth: POST sign in
# @name signin
POST http://localhost:3000/auth/signin
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "salman.test@example.com",
  "password": "Test1234"
}

### U3 - Users: GET all WITHOUT token (expect 401)
GET http://localhost:3000/api/users

### U4 - Users: GET all WITH token
GET http://localhost:3000/api/users
Authorization: Bearer {{signin.response.body.token}}

### U5 - Users: GET by id
GET http://localhost:3000/api/users/{{createUser.response.body._id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{signin.response.body.token}}

### U6 - Users: PUT by id
PUT http://localhost:3000/api/users/{{createUser.response.body._id}}
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{signin.response.body.token}}

{
  "name": "Salman Shafi Updated"
}

### U7 - Users: DELETE by id
DELETE http://localhost:3000/api/users/{{createUser.response.body._id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{signin.response.body.token}}

### U8 - Users: DELETE all
DELETE http://localhost:3000/api/users
Authorization: Bearer {{signin.response.body.token}}

### U9 - Auth: GET sign out
GET http://localhost:3000/auth/signout